ssos x $1 = $<<2*1=2>>2\nIn total Sandy pays $6 + $6 + $3 + $2 = $<<6+6+3+2=17>>17\nSandy will receive $20 - $17 = $<<20-17=3>>3 in change\n#### 3", "prompt": "Solve the following grade-school math problem. Show your reasoning and put the final answer in \\boxed{}.\n\nProblem: Cappuccinos cost $2, iced teas cost $3, cafe lattes cost $1.5 and espressos cost $1 each. Sandy orders some drinks for herself and some friends. She orders three cappuccinos, two iced teas, two cafe lattes, and two espressos. How much change does she receive back for a twenty-dollar bill?\nSolution:", "solutions": ["3"], "solution": "3"}, "prompt_tokens": [151644, 872, 198, 50, 3948, 279, 2701, 11972, 34689, 6888, 3491, 13, 6928, 697, 32711, 323, 2182, 279, 1590, 4226, 304, 1124, 79075, 6257, 382, 31198, 25, 356, 676, 14570, 15215, 2783, 400, 17, 11, 220, 7572, 29568, 2783, 400, 18, 11, 40930, 326, 1587, 288, 2783, 400, 16, 13, 20, 323, 1531, 1873, 436, 2783, 400, 16, 1817, 13, 38385, 10163, 1045, 20987], "response_tokens": [151667, 198, 32313, 11, 1077, 594, 1490, 13, 38385, 6801, 311, 1973, 1045, 20987, 11, 323, 582, 1184, 311, 7071, 700, 1246, 1753, 2297, 1340, 5221, 1182, 504, 264, 400, 17, 15, 4031, 13, 2932, 11457, 1045, 3151, 20987, 13, 6771, 752, 1438, 432, 1495, 3019, 553, 3019, 382, 5338, 11, 1077, 752, 1140, 700, 279, 32676, 1340, 11457, 25, 2326, 272, 676, 14570]}
