ed form, \\boxed{74}.\n</think>\n\nTo solve the problem, we start by expressing the relationships between the heights of Jesse, Kelly, and Jana. \n\n1. Jessie is 72 inches tall.\n2. Kelly is 3 inches shorter than Jessie, so Kelly's height is $ 72 - 3 = 69 $ inches.\n3. Jana is 5 inches taller than Kelly, so Jana's height is $ 69 + 5 = 74 $ inches.\n\nThus, Jana is \\boxed{74} inches tall.<|im_end|>", "source_record": {"question": "Jana is 5 inches taller than Kelly, and Kelly is 3 inches shorter than Jess. If Jess is 72 inches tall, how tall is Jana?", "answer": "Kelly is 72-3=<<72-3=69>>69 inches tall.\nJana is 69+5=<<69+5=74>>74 inches tall.\n#### 74", "prompt": "Solve the following grade-school math problem. Show your reasoning and put the final answer in \\boxed{}.\n\nProblem: Jana is 5 inches taller than Kelly, and Kelly is 3 inches shorter than Jess. If Jess is 72 inches tall, how tall is Jana?\nSolution:", "solutions": ["74"], "solution": "74"}, "prompt_tokens": [151644, 872, 198, 50, 3948, 279, 2701, 11972, 34689, 6888, 3491, 13, 6928, 697, 32711, 323, 2182, 279, 1590, 4226, 304, 1124, 79075, 6257, 382, 31198, 25, 619, 3362, 374, 220, 20, 14924, 49909, 1091, 18661, 11, 323, 18661, 374, 220, 18, 14924, 23327, 1091, 23039, 13, 1416, 23039, 374, 220, 22, 17, 14924, 16217, 11, 1246, 16217, 374, 619, 3362, 5267, 36842, 25], "response_tokens": [151667, 198, 32313, 11, 1077, 594, 1430, 311, 7071, 700, 419, 3491, 13, 2055, 11, 582, 614, 2326, 1251, 25, 619, 3362, 11, 18661, 11, 323, 23039, 13, 576, 3491, 2727, 429, 619, 3362, 374, 220, 20, 14924, 49909, 1091, 18661, 11, 323, 18661, 374, 220, 18, 14924, 23327, 1091, 23039, 13, 7281, 11, 23039, 374, 220, 22, 17, 14924, 16217, 13, 1205, 1184]}
