nds each week for 8 weeks:  \n   $2.5 \\, \\text{pounds/week} \\times 8 \\, \\text{weeks} = 20 \\, \\text{pounds}$.\n\n3. Combined weight loss:  \n   $15 \\, \\text{pounds} + 20 \\, \\text{pounds} = 35 \\, \\text{pounds}$.\n\n$$\n\\boxed{35}\n$$<|im_end|>", "source_record": {"question": "Aleesia lost 1.5 pounds each week for 10 weeks. Alexei lost 2.5 pounds each week for 8 weeks. How many pounds did the two friends combine to lose?", "answer": "Alessia = 1.5 * 10 = <<1.5*10=15>>15 pounds\nAlexei = 2.5 * 8 = <<2.5*8=20>>20 pounds\n15 + 20 = <<15+20=35>>35 pounds\nTogether they lost 35 pounds.\n#### 35", "prompt": "Solve the following grade-school math problem. Show your reasoning and put the final answer in \\boxed{}.\n\nProblem: Aleesia lost 1.5 pounds each week for 10 weeks. Alexei lost 2.5 pounds each week for 8 weeks. How many pounds did the two friends combine to lose?\nSolution:", "solutions": ["35"], "solution": "35"}, "prompt_tokens": [151644, 872, 198, 50, 3948, 279, 2701, 11972, 34689, 6888, 3491, 13, 6928, 697, 32711, 323, 2182, 279, 1590, 4226, 304, 1124, 79075, 6257, 382, 31198, 25, 19081, 288, 685, 5558, 220, 16, 13, 20, 16302, 1817, 2003, 369, 220, 16, 15, 5555, 13, 8515, 19972, 5558, 220, 17, 13, 20, 16302, 1817, 2003, 369, 220, 23, 5555, 13, 2585, 1657, 16302, 1521, 279], "response_tokens": [151667, 198, 32313, 11, 1077, 594, 1490, 13, 576, 3491, 2727, 19081, 288, 685, 5558, 220, 16, 13, 20, 16302, 1817, 2003, 369, 220, 16, 15, 5555, 13, 2055, 1156, 11, 358, 1184, 311, 11047, 1246, 1753, 19081, 288, 685, 5558, 304, 2790, 13, 8704, 432, 594, 220, 16, 13, 20, 16302, 817, 2003, 54916, 553, 220, 16, 15, 5555, 11, 429, 1035, 387]}
